B.bzd=new A.yW(3,"Set a Deadline",'Third, set a deadline for your goal. A deadline acts as a "forcing system\u201d in your subconscious mind. It motivates you to do the things necessary to make your goal come true. If it is a big enough goal, set sub-deadlines as well. Don\u2019t leave this to chance.')
